1N4735A laboratory DC sweep
* Altium Designer Winter 09 Mixed Sim
* Uin is the measured potentiometer wiper voltage relative to ground.
* Sweep its ideal equivalent source to compare the same Uin values.
VSWEEP Uin 0 DC 0
R1 Uin Ud 1k
D1 Ud 0 1N4735
.SAVE Uin Ud @R1[i] VSWEEP#branch
*PLOT DC -1 1 A=Ud A=@R1[i]
.DC VSWEEP -20 20 0.01
.OPTIONS RELTOL=1e-6 ABSTOL=1e-12 VNTOL=1e-9 TEMP=27
*1N4735
*Ref: Motorola
*6.2V 1W Si Zener pkg:DIODE0.4 1,2
.MODEL 1N4735 D(IS=7.57E-16 RS=0.968 TT=5.01E-8 CJO=1.41E-10 VJ=0.75 
+ M=0.33 BV=6.163 IBV=0.041 )
* Origin: Mcediode.lib

.END
